  "term": "child pornography",
  "definition": "Child pornography is an older term for child sexual abuse material: images or videos, including photorealistic AI-generated media, that depict sexual activity involving a child or show a child nude or partly nude in a sexually suggestive way. The term is criticized because it can imply consent, so child sexual abuse material is often preferred.",
